---
description: RebarOptima UI system rules (always apply)
alwaysApply: true
---

PROJECT: RebarOptima / CraveToBuild, React + Vite frontend. Users are site engineers on phones and tablets, outdoors.

HARD RULES
- Frontend only. No backend, API, DB, calculation, route or permission changes. No route renamed (Site Inventory stays /general-inventory).
- No feature, button, field, label, tab, column or export is removed or renamed. Held items (do not touch): summary date range in Ledger, and merging the Actual Pour and Proportions modals in Casting.
- Inline edit/delete on tables stays inline, with "Yes / No".
- Never invent data. No fallback fake rows, no made-up rates (the old 60 per kg is banned), no placeholder vendors. Unpriced items show "No price".
- SHOW_FINANCIALS (utils/steelFinancials) stays false: no price, rate, cost, GST or valuation anywhere in the UI, prints, PDF or Excel for Steel.

DESIGN SYSTEM (already built in frontend/src/components/ui and index.css tokens)
- Use ONLY shared components: Button, Drawer, Modal, Card, KpiCard, Table, Badge, Tabs, SearchInput, PageLayout, Skeletons (TableSkeleton, CardSkeleton, KpiSkeleton, useDelayedSkeleton).
- Use ONLY tokens: --accent (single brand color), --main-bg, --card-bg, --card-border, --text-primary/secondary/label, semantic -text/-subtle variants, --table-header-bg, --table-row-hover, --input-bg/--input-border, spacing, radius tokens. NEVER hardcode hex/rgb/hsl colors, dark navy backgrounds, or white-alpha overlays (rgba(255,255,255,x)) in CSS or inline JSX styles. Never use an undefined var(--name).
- data-theme on <html> is the single source of truth for light/dark. No @media (prefers-color-scheme) overrides in page CSS. color-scheme must follow the active theme.
- Light mode: only the sidebar, tooltips and filled primary/danger buttons may be dark. Dark mode: no hardcoded light surfaces or dark text.
- Forms and multi-field flows use the shared Drawer (full-screen on phones). Modal is only for short confirmations.
- Icons: Lucide only, no emojis. Headings, table headers and labels in sentence case (no all-caps). Plain, human copy.
- Tables: text left, numbers right (tabular), status centered. On phones, tables become cards or scroll inside their own wrapper. No page-level horizontal scroll.
- Touch targets 44px on coarse pointers, 36px on desktop. Inputs 16px font minimum on phones.
- Every list/table that loads data shows a skeleton (150ms delay, 300ms minimum) and has distinct empty, no-results and error states.
- Every screen uses PageLayout (same max width and padding).

PROCESS RULES
- The build passing proves nothing. After changes, run: eslint (no-undef, react/jsx-no-undef as errors), the undefined-CSS-variable check, and the Playwright QA (npm run design-qa). Never claim "done" or "verified" without running them. Mark untested things as "untested".
- Commit after each phase with a clear message. Fix root causes, not symptoms.